		"description": "<p><em>Nim+ Volume I variant rule (TwinSteel): alternative starting equipment for the Oathsworn.</em></p><p>Take this set <strong>instead of</strong> the Oathsworn’s standard starting equipment. Choose it in the character creator’s Starting Equipment step, or drop this kit on your character; either way it grants:</p><ul><li>Pole Hammer</li><li>Rusty Mail</li><li>Padlock & Key</li></ul><p>Afterwards you may delete this kit item (the granted gear stays), and remember to remove the standard starting equipment if your character already received it.</p>",
